{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuMVfXvj2r7uy3UbmsDC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I created the dashboard and the alert rule in Kibana. The rule ran once with status `ok`, so its query is valid. I couldn't confirm the query actually matches 5xx documents, because Kibana's console proxy is disabled on this instance.\n\n**1. What the data holds.** Each document in `Kibana Sample Data Logs` is one web request. The main fields are:\n- time: `timestamp`\n- client and visitor: `clientip`, `agent`, `machine.os`\n- request: `request`, `url`, `extension`, `referer`\n- response: `response`, the HTTP status code, stored as a string\n- size: `bytes`\n- location: `geo.src`, `geo.dest`, `geo.coordinates`\n- other: `tags`, `host`\n\n**2. Dashboard: \"EFF-1a5f9c02 Web logs overview\"** (id `eff-1a5f9c02-web-logs-overview-e90c9ac2df62`, [open it](http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-1a5f9c02-web-logs-overview-e90c9ac2df62)). It has 7 panels:\n- Total requests\n- Unique visitors (distinct `clientip`)\n- Total bytes served\n- Requests over time (line chart)\n- Requests by response code (pie chart)\n- Top 10 requested URLs, with request count and bytes (table)\n- Traffic by source country, top 10 (bar chart)\n\n**3. Alert rule: \"EFF-1a5f9c02 5xx spike\"** (id `a90550f9-1714-407d-a6d9-a2e2d5df9a97`). It's an Elasticsearch query rule on `kibana_sample_data_logs`. It runs every minute and fires when more than 10 requests with a response code from 500 to 599 arrive within 5 minutes. I turned it on when creating it. It has no actions attached, so when it fires it creates alerts but doesn't notify anyone.\n\nBecause `response` is a string field, the rule compares codes as text. That works for normal three-digit status codes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":21778,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":231},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0536cbf5-c97a-5467-80bd-e50c5d30a2ce","uuid":"4aae14d5-974d-45d4-9d79-132fb6171f87","timestamp":"2026-10-10T22:35:11.808Z","request_id":"req_011CfuMVfLXKc21WunGeQPtk"}
